c optimize nofile budget 5
```c
/* c optimize must not prove a rewrite that silently fixes an unsequenced
 * evaluation order: bad is left untouched and reported as "not lowered",
 * while the ordinary function below may still be rewritten. */
int bad(int x){int i=0;return i++ + i++ + x;}
int good(int x){int i=0;i=i+1;return i+x;}
int fold(int x){return (x+1)-1;}
```
